  "releaseNotes": "Fix (Martin Honnen): fn:xml-to-json now honors the 'indent' option — xml-to-json($x, map { 'indent': true() }) produces indented multi-line JSON instead of a single line. Internal: output serialization is consolidated through one FinalizeOutput pipeline and shared JSON/character-escaping primitives; the character escaper now lives in PhoenixmlDb.Core and is shared with the XQuery engine so both escape identically. Builds against PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.9 and PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.5. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
